// lexdb over TNS: statements that ended the server ("Lexell: decimal result is not exactly representable": a Decimal
// operator given a result of more than 38 digits) and now give Oracle's answer: a DATE or a TIMESTAMP plus or minus a number
// of days with 38 digits (n / 97), in SELECT, INSERT ... SELECT into a DATE column (3,000 rows), UPDATE, TRUNC, ROUND and
// TIME_BUCKET of it (whole seconds, the fraction rounded half away from zero, as Oracle's DATE arithmetic; a TIMESTAMP's
// fraction dropped), NUMTODSINTERVAL of such a number, an INTERVAL times one, MONTHS_BETWEEN's fraction, WIDTH_BUCKET of
// 38-digit bounds, PERCENTILE_CONT and PERCENTILE_DISC of a 38-digit fraction or over 38-digit values (grouped, over
// windows); ORA-01841 past Oracle's years, ORA-01873. Checked against Oracle Database Free 23.26 (gen_oracle.py --check
// tns_decfit: the answers below are Oracle's; lexdb's numbers have 38 digits where Oracle's have 40, equal to 30). Each
// statement runs with set lexdb_batch = off (the row engine) and on: "same" and the answer, or DIFFERENT and both.
// expect: setup: 5 statements
// expect: same: N,LO,HI,ND,TLO,THI = 3000|'2024-03-05T00:14:51'|'2024-04-04T22:16:05'|3000|'2024-03-05T00:14:50.721649'|'2024-04-04T22:16:04.948454'
// expect: same: ID,D,T,X = 1|'2024-03-05T00:14:51'|'2024-03-05T00:14:50.721649'|0.0103092783505154639175257731958762887;2|'2024-03-05T00:29:41'|'2024-03-05T00:29:41.443299'|0.0206185567010309278350515463917525773;3|'2024-03-05T00:44:32'|'2024-03-05T00:44:32.164948'|0.030927835051546391752577319587628866;97|'2024-03-06T00:00:00'|'2024-03-06T00:00:00'|1;1000|'2024-03-15T07:25:22'|'2024-03-15T07:25:21.649485'|10.30927835051546391752577319587628866;3000|'2024-04-04T22:16:05'|'2024-04-04T22:16:04.948454'|30.927835051546391752577319587628865979
// expect: same: 500 / N,ND,HI = 500|500|'2024-03-10T03:42:41'
// expect: same: 1 / 1 / ID,D = 1|'2024-03-04T23:45:10'
// expect: same: A,B,C,D = '2024-03-05T00:29:41'|'2024-03-05T00:14:51'|'2024-03-04T23:30:19'|'2024-03-05T00:29:41'
// expect: same: A,B,C = '2024-03-04T23:30:19'|'2024-03-06T10:00:00'|'2024-03-05T09:59:59'
// expect: same: A,B,C,D,E = '2024-03-05T00:00:01'|'2024-03-05T00:00:00'|'2024-03-04T23:59:59'|'2024-03-05T00:00:00'|'1950-03-04T23:30:19'
// expect: same: ID,A,B,C = 1|'2024-03-05T00:29:42'|'2024-03-05T00:00:00'|'2024-03-05T00:29:42';2|'2024-03-05T00:59:22'|'2024-03-05T00:00:00'|'2024-03-05T00:59:22';3|'2024-03-05T01:29:04'|'2024-03-05T00:00:00'|'2024-03-05T01:29:04';3000|'2024-05-05T20:32:10'|'2024-03-05T00:00:00'|'2024-05-05T20:32:10'
// expect: same: error 1841
// expect: same: A,B,C = '2024-03-05T00:29:00'|'2024-03-05T00:00:00'|'2024-03-05T00:00:00'
// expect: same: H,N = '2024-03-05T00:00:00'|2;'2024-03-05T01:00:00'|2;'2024-03-05T02:00:00'|2;'2024-03-05T03:00:00'|2
// expect: same: A,B,C,D,E = 41.443299|29|14.226804|1|0
// expect: same: B,C = '+012345678-11'|'+000000001-00'
